   "file": "EpsilonEridani/QFT/Scattering/DIS/Tensors/Decomposition.lean",
   "fix": "Swap the iff so the existence is on the left (`(\u2203 F1 F2 c, W = fromF1F2 g K F1 F2 + c \u2022 A) \u2194 IsProperLorentzCovariant g K W \u2227 \u2026`), keeping the name; or rename to describe the current LHS.",
